OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after mystery tortoise
OL,4,Arescued from busy road
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfficers have appealed for help to
OL,7,Ftrace the owner of a tortoise after it
OL,8,Fwas rescued from a busy road in
OL,9,FNottinghamshire.
OL,11,FNottinghamshire Police said PC Chris
OL,12,FBrentnall was travelling along Colwick
OL,13,FLoop Road, in Gedling, near the
OL,14,Fjunction with Magenta Way, shortly
OL,15,Fbefore 15:00 BST on Tuesday, when he
OL,16,Fstopped to assist what appeared to be a
OL,17,Fbroken-down vehicle.
OL,19,FHowever, the officer soon discovered
OL,20,Fthe driver had spotted a tortoise in
OL,21,Fthe middle of the road and had pulled
OL,22,Fover to bring it to safety.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
