OL,3,GNEWSAAppeal after mystery tortoise
OL,4,Arescued from busy road
OL,5,
OL,6,FBrentnall said the tortoise appeared to
OL,7,Fbe "unharmed" and was taken to a
OL,8,Fveterinary centre to be checked over
OL,9,Fand scanned for a chip - but was found
OL,10,Fnot to have one.
